{"id":"eyazr7qfrutxadrdskhty566i","title":"仙霞古道与东南阙里：衢州的文化探寻","originalTitle":"走仙霞古道，访东南阙里，衢州危险赞","summary":"作者因小说创作两次访问衢州，探寻仙霞古道与东南阙里的文化遗迹。廿八都的青石板街巷和文昌宫的藻井天花展现了浙西的古风古韵，南孔家庙则见证了孔氏南宗的千年文脉。胡柚的丰收季节，更添一份山野果香。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=616948&do=blog&id=1561484"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T03:38:40.651Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T03:38:40.651Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":16,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}